# Owner 2026-11-13 (pt-BR): "onde nao da pra lancar o jogo via o exe, tem que lancar pelo launcher". The launcher puts a ticket in the
# environment variable CINDERS_TICKET of the game process (launcher/src/ticket.rs); main() checks it before anything else.
#  * chaosticket.h (pure, OpenSSL): t1.<build>.<launcher>.<expiry>.<nonce>.<mac>, mac = HMAC-SHA256(sub_key, "t1|build|launcher|
#    expiry|nonce"), sub_key = HKDF-SHA256(client guard key, info "cinders-launcher-ticket-v1"): the launcher holds the sub key, never
#    the key the game proves itself to the server with. Checked: shape, mac in constant time, expiry (30 s), build. Vector shared with
#    the launcher and client/tools/ticket_vector_test.py; client/tools/chaosticket_test.cpp builds the header on its own.
#  * chaoslauncher.h (platform): requireOrExit() reads and removes the variable, and when the ticket is not good tells the player
